---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Understand how Tax Clarity NG calculates your PAYE tax under the 2026 Nigeria Tax Act — deductions, progressive bands, and take-home pay explained step by step." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#008751" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>How It Works — Tax Clarity NG</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-cream min-h-screen font-sans antialiased selection:bg-ng-green/30 selection:text-charcoal">

    <!-- Subtle background pattern -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03]"
         style="background-image: radial-gradient(#121212 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;">
    </div>

    <main class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">

      <!-- Back link -->
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-charcoal/70 hover:text-ng-green transition-colors mb-8 group">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-charcoal bg-white shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212] group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:shadow-neo-sm group-active:translate-x-0.5 group-active:translate-y-0.5 group-active:shadow-neo-active transition-all duration-150">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        Back to Calculator
      </a>

      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="mb-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-ng-green border-2 border-charcoal"></span>
          <span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-charcoal"></span>
          <span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-ng-green border-2 border-charcoal"></span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-charcoal tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3">
          How <span class="text-ng-green">Tax Clarity NG</span> Works
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-charcoal/80 font-medium max-w-2xl">
          A plain-language walkthrough of how your PAYE tax is calculated under the <strong class="text-charcoal">2026 Nigeria Tax Act (NTA)</strong>.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- STEP 1: GROSS INCOME -->
      <section class="space-y-8">

        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">1</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Start With Your Gross Annual Income</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            This is your <strong>total yearly salary before any deductions</strong> the full amount your employer pays you. If you're paid monthly, multiply that figure by 12.
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-ng-green/8 border-2 border-ng-green/30">
            <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/80">
              <strong class="text-ng-green">Example:</strong> If you earn ₦400,000 per month, your gross annual income is <strong>₦400,000 × 12 = ₦4,800,000</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">2</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Deductions Are Subtracted</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Before the government calculates your tax, certain amounts are <strong>removed from your gross income</strong>. These are called <em>deductions</em> they reduce the amount of income that gets taxed. You're essentially telling the government: <em>"Don't tax me on this portion."</em>
          </p>

          <!-- Pension -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream border-2 border-charcoal/15">
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-charcoal mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6] border border-charcoal/30 shrink-0"></span>
                Pension Contribution — 8% of Gross Income
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/75 leading-relaxed">
                Under the <strong>Pension Reform Act</strong>, employees contribute <strong>8%</strong> of their gross salary to their Retirement Savings Account (RSA). This portion is <strong>not subject to income tax</strong> it gets deducted before PAYE is calculated.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-charcoal/10">
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/70">
                  <strong>Example:</strong> Gross = ₦4,800,000 → Pension = 8% × ₦4,800,000 = <strong class="text-charcoal">₦384,000</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Rent Relief -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream border-2 border-charcoal/15">
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-charcoal mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B] border border-charcoal/30 shrink-0"></span>
                Rent Relief 20% of Annual Rent Paid
                <span class="neo-badge text-[10px]">New in 2026</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/75 leading-relaxed">
                The 2026 NTA introduced a new benefit: if you pay rent, you can <strong>deduct 20% of your annual rent</strong> from your taxable income. This relief is <strong>capped at ₦500,000</strong> so even if 20% of your rent is ₦700k, you only get ₦500k.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-charcoal/10">
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/70">
                  <strong>Example:</strong> Rent = ₦1,200,000 → 20% = ₦240,000 → Relief = <strong class="text-charcoal">₦240,000</strong> (under the ₦500k cap)
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Chargeable income -->
          <div class="mt-5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal text-white">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider opacity-70 mb-1">What remains is your Chargeable Income</p>
            <p class="text-base font-bold leading-relaxed">
              Chargeable Income = Gross Income - Pension - Rent Relief
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-80 mt-2">
              Example: ₦4,800,000 - ₦384,000 - ₦240,000 = <strong>₦4,176,000</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">3</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Progressive Tax Bands Are Applied</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Nigeria uses a <strong>progressive tax system</strong>. This means your income isn't taxed at one flat rate instead, different <em>slices</em> of your income are taxed at different rates. Lower income is taxed less, higher income is taxed more.
          </p>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Think of it like filling buckets. Your chargeable income fills the first bucket (₦800k) at 0% tax. Whatever overflows goes into the next bucket at 15%, and so on.
          </p>

          <!-- Bands table -->
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b-[3px] border-charcoal">
                  <th class="text-left py-3 font-extrabold text-charcoal">Income Band</th>
                  <th class="text-center py-3 font-extrabold text-charcoal">Tax Rate</th>
                  <th class="text-right py-3 font-extrabold text-charcoal">Max Tax in Band</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10 bg-ng-green/5">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">First ₦800,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-ng-green">0% - FREE</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal">₦0</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">₦800,000 - ₦3,000,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-charcoal">15%</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal">₦330,000</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10 bg-cream">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">₦3,000,000 - ₦12,000,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-charcoal">18%</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal">₦1,620,000</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">₦12,000,000 - ₦25,000,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-charcoal">21%</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal">₦2,730,000</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10 bg-cream">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">₦25,000,000 - ₦50,000,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-charcoal">23%</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal">₦5,750,000</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-charcoal/10">
                  <td class="py-3 font-medium text-charcoal/80">Above ₦50,000,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-center font-bold text-charcoal">25%</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-right font-bold text-charcoal/50">No limit</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <!-- Worked example -->
          <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-ng-green/8 border-2 border-ng-green/30">
            <h3 class="font-extrabold text-charcoal mb-2">Worked Example: Chargeable Income of ₦4,176,000</h3>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal/80">
              <p>• First ₦800,000 at <strong class="text-ng-green">0%</strong> = ₦0</p>
              <p>• Next ₦2,200,000 (₦800k → ₦3M) at <strong>15%</strong> = ₦330,000</p>
              <p>• Remaining ₦1,176,000 (₦3M → ₦4.176M) at <strong>18%</strong> = ₦211,680</p>
              <div class="pt-2 mt-2 border-t border-ng-green/20">
                <p class="font-extrabold text-charcoal">Total PAYE Tax = ₦330,000 + ₦211,680 = <span class="text-ng-green">₦541,680</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">4</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Your Net Take-Home Pay</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Finally, your <strong>net take-home pay</strong> is what you actually receive after the government takes PAYE tax and your pension contribution is set aside.
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider opacity-80 mb-1">Formula</p>
            <p class="text-base font-bold">
              Net Take-Home = Gross Income - PAYE Tax - Pension Contribution
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-85 mt-2">
              Example: ₦4,800,000 - ₦541,680 - ₦384,000 = <strong>₦3,874,320</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-85 mt-1">
              Monthly: ₦3,874,320 ÷ 12 = <strong>₦322,860</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5: Effective Rate -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-ng-green text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">5</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Effective Tax Rate</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Your <strong>effective tax rate</strong> is the <em>actual percentage of your gross income</em> that goes to PAYE tax. Because of the progressive system and your deductions, it's always <strong>lower</strong> than the highest band rate you fall into.
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream border-2 border-charcoal/15">
            <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/80">
              <strong>Example:</strong> ₦541,680 tax on ₦4,800,000 gross = <strong class="text-ng-green">11.28%</strong> effective rate, even though you're in the 18% band.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pie Chart explanation -->
        <div class="neo-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-charcoal text-white font-black text-lg border-2 border-charcoal shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#121212]">📊</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-charcoal">Understanding the Chart</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            The donut chart shows how your <strong>gross income is split</strong> across four categories:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-cream">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 rounded-sm shrink-0 border-2 border-charcoal" style="background:#00A86B"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-charcoal text-sm">Net Take-Home</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/65">What hits your bank account</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-cream">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 rounded-sm shrink-0 border-2 border-charcoal" style="background:#121212"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-charcoal text-sm">PAYE Tax</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/65">Paid to the government</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-cream">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 rounded-sm shrink-0 border-2 border-charcoal" style="background:#3B82F6"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-charcoal text-sm">Pension</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/65">Saved in your RSA for retirement</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-cream">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 rounded-sm shrink-0 border-2 border-charcoal" style="background:#F59E0B"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-charcoal text-sm">Rent Relief</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal/65">Tax savings from your rent deduction</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA: Back to calculator -->
        <div class="text-center pt-4">
          <a href="/"
             class="neo-card inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-ng-green text-white px-8 py-4 text-lg font-extrabold rounded-2xl hover:-translate-x-1 hover:-translate-y-1 active:translate-x-0.5 active:translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-150">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            Try the Calculator Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="mt-14 mb-8 text-center text-xs text-charcoal/70 font-medium space-y-1 max-w-md mx-auto px-4">
        <p>Built on the <strong class="text-charcoal">2026 Nigeria Tax Act (NTA)</strong></p>
        <p>This is an educational tool. Consult a tax professional for official advice.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-ng-green border border-charcoal/30"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white border border-charcoal/30"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-ng-green border border-charcoal/30"></span>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
